Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't wanna live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.28,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,710)\bord2.2\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(984,0)\t(939,984,\1a&H00&)}Reverse Mountain
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.28,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,710)\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(984,0)}Reverse Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've had that brooding look\Non your face for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I hoped I\Nwas dreaming. About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may sound crazy, but it\Nseems to me we're not even moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, the sail doesn't\Nappear to be catching any wind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've entered the Calm Belt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Calm Belt? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm Belt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A part of the sea where\Nnothing moves a muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's muscles and clams? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that, an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good trick since we're at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of this chit-chat isn't\Ngoing to get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fold the sails and start paddling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get back on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me. Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, this is a sailboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we need to paddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would we go through the trouble of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doubling back when the\NMarines are waiting for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's no time to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least it's nice and quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I need to explain it to you, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our haste to escape from the Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ended up going too far south and now\Nwe're off course and stuck out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we entered the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were at the Grand Line, you think\NI'd waste my time explaining this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is sandwiched in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between these two green\Nareas you see here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These areas, just as they're labeled,\Nare what's called the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows why, but inside the Calm\NBelt, there's no wind and no current.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a void where\Neverything's stagnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that sailboats move by catching\Nwinds, this is more than a dangerous region.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can be fatal, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, but it sounds like\Nwe're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, you retained more\Nthan I thought you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what that geezer meant\Nwhen he said it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains why we haven't\Ngotten a single gust of wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna get out of\Nthis if our ship can't move?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the wind will start blowing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind never blows in the calm belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another good reason that\Npeople call this area dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's infested with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Calm Belt is also\Nhome to the Sea Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's their main place for breeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the biggest reason\Npeople can't cross the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idea how we get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to give them any\Nreason to stick around or eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they're gone, we'll paddle back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call that a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't improve anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like it's gonna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please yourselves, I think\Nthis behemoth's gonna sneeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we're back\Non our original course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the map, we should be\Nspotting the red line anytime now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, we're almost there,\Nthe Grand Line at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this exciting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally here! We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the path to the Grand Line really as\Nperilous as it's drawn here? Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with the rumors\Nand these drawings confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As unimaginable as it may seem, the\Nentrance to the Grand Line is a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what, did we crash into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't believe it, but the map's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mountain appears to be\Nriddled with small canals,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we might have to go up and over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if there are canals or whatever,\Na ship can't climb up a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the map says otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and if Nami thinks\Nsomething can be done, then it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but remember, that map was stolen\Nfrom Buggy the Clown, so can we trust if...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case no one noticed,\Nthe rudder's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little help over here, be nice, Sanji!\NWould you please give Usopp a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't think with all his shouting\NIt's happening right away, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, does this current seem\Nunusually strong to anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, what did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked if any of you noticed the\Ninsane strength of this current.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The current?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be... What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The canals do go up the\Nmountain. Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could that possibly work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guiding light was directing us\Ntoward this spot on the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Notice how it's labeled\Nhere, Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little help over here, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These green lines represent\Ncanals, or artificial waterways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If major currents from all four\Noceans flow toward this mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you think's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The currents would force\Nwater up these canals,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,collide at the top, and then flow\Nstraight down into the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Reverse Mountain is a winter\Nmountain, so it's cold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means any surface\Ncurrents that don't flow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up the canal will be\Nforced down as they cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything riding those currents\Nwould be pulled down as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we screw up and miss\Nthe entrance to the canal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Going Mary will be\Ncarried straight into
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Red Line's rock base\Nand likely be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ship and crew would be sucked\Nto the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's a mystery mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not my point at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since we're positioned on this current,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we shouldn't run into any problems\Ngetting to the summit of Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only thing that would hurt us now is if\Nsomething went wrong with the rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me a skeptic, but ships\Ndo not climb mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've heard a few stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stories about the Mystery Mountain? No,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I have heard is that more\Nthan half the people who try
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make it to the Grand Line\Ndie before they even get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever we find, it\Nisn't going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, could you get the sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything for you, Nami! Luffy, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see the mystery mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insanely huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bigger than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taller than the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting sucked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the rudder steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that entrance\Nyou were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we keep this heading, we're\Ngoing to crash into the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a crack in that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:09:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us a direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep bearing straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious! Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have we made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the canal entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to be dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean really is\Nflowing up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make our way through\Nthose water gates just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or we'll crash into the red\Nline and be smashed to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're drifting off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go more to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your back into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The runner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab a hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's just a straight\Nshot to the summit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, great view!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how high we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not in the clouds, we're above them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing! We've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've reached the summit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest\Nsea in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere out there, the One Piece\Nis waiting, and we're gonna find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys just hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was probably just the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this speed, everything\Nsounds distorted!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a mountain up ahead!\NWhat? That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we pass the twin caves up ahead,\Nthere should be nothing but ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a black wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.21,0:14:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots, how are we supposed\Nto fight a hundred-ton whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.99,0:14:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our path is blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we escape? Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this creature looks like a giant wall\Nto us, We must be a speck! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's highly possible that this thing\Nisn't even aware that we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll run right into it\Nunless we change course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can get by on the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Port to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rudder's broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything! Wait! I know!\NThis will work! It has to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:14:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's not going to turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was my special scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here\Nbefore it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind telling me\Nwhat the heck is going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so big that the cannonball\Ndidn't even make it flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That or his reaction time's really slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can break my special seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.49,0:16:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not through with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up before you kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been swallowed whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want my friend! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think\Nyou're going, you jerk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:18:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You give them back right now, you whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you big bone,\NI'm not gonna ask again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop sinking, I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends and me are on\Nan important adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think? I don't know what\Nto think. Is this even real? Because
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what I saw and what I\Nfelt we were swallowed by the whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd say that's a fair guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what's with this island\Nand the house? Illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, that looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Great Game Squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope it's a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giant squids, guys with harpoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.59,0:19:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where is Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about whales,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since when do they have\Ndoors and lighted hallways?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:19:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should fire a cannon there! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wrote you a love song\Nto let you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be with you\Ntill the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when the sparkles fade, doubts\Ninvade our ones so trusting might.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.01,0:20:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you that I will stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll find a way to look\Nthrough the cloudy skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We built a castle of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we're watching it wash away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:21:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time round we'll\Nbuild a stronger love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got me heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanna hold you and not let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that I'll be with\Nyou till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got me heart and soul.

